&lt;hr &#x2F;&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&quot;gwanryeon-kiweodeu-mic-baljeon-heureumdo&quot;&gt;관련 키워드 및 발전 흐름도&lt;&#x2F;h2&gt;
&lt;pre data-lang=&quot;text&quot; class=&quot;language-text &quot;&gt;&lt;code class=&quot;language-text&quot; data-lang=&quot;text&quot;&gt;Pulse Code Modulation
